@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
skinparam wrapWidth 180
<style>
root {
  FontName Helvetica
  FontSize 14
  FontColor #1F2937
}
element { BackgroundColor #F1F5F9; LineColor #475569; LineThickness 1.2; RoundCorner 6 }
arrow   { LineColor #475569; LineThickness 1.2; FontSize 12; MaximumWidth 180 }
note    { BackgroundColor #FFF7E0; LineColor #B45309; FontSize 12; MaximumWidth 220 }
title   { FontSize 18; FontStyle bold }
caption { FontSize 12; FontColor #64748B }
legend  { FontSize 12; BackgroundColor white; LineColor #CBD5E1; MaximumWidth 320 }
.accent { BackgroundColor #1D4ED8; FontColor white; LineColor #1E3A8A }
.alert  { BackgroundColor #FEE2E2; FontColor #7F1D1D; LineColor #B91C1C }
.muted  { BackgroundColor #F8FAFC; FontColor #64748B; LineColor #CBD5E1 }
</style>
hide <<accent>> stereotype
hide <<alert>> stereotype
hide <<muted>> stereotype
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 60

title UML package diagram: application modules that depend on persisted report data
hide empty members

package "Screens" as Screens {
}
package "Use-case controllers" as Controllers {
}
package "Data services" as DataServices {
}
package "Persisted entities" as Entities <<accent>> {
}
package "Report status states" as StatusStates <<muted>> {
}
package "Persistence access" as Access {
}

Screens --> Controllers : calls use cases
Controllers --> DataServices : requests report and user data
DataServices --> Access : persists through
DataServices --> Entities : loads and saves
Entities --> StatusStates : holds current status
Controllers --> Entities : uses report category
Screens --> Entities : picks report category

note right of Entities
  User, Citizen, MunicipalOperator, Credentials,
  Report, Location, ReportCategory, StatusUpdate,
  InternalNote, Notification
end note
note right of StatusStates
  Submitted, Assigned, InProgress, Resolved:
  rebuilt from the stored status text, not persisted
end note
note right of Access
  Generic find, save and update on the
  persistence unit (MySQL database reports_db)
end note

legend right
  Blue: the persisted data. Grey: not stored.
  Arrows point from the dependent module to the module it needs.
endlegend
@enduml
